    "status": "live",
    "notes": "The Pacific Northwest's motorik dream pop (run C, task C8; the maintainer: \"feel free to make more for all regions\"). A glassy arpeggio and a pad open alone, then the motorik drive (kick on one, three and the and of three, snare on two and four) under a bass in eighths, a crest where a wall of chiming chords and a soaring lead come in, a haze that drops the drums and the bass, and the crest again, at 124-146 bpm (src/audio/radio-compose-trio.ts, preset dream-band). Melodies are generated from each track's seed, so they are original. Cut a track by setting its status to vetoed.",
